#. Description of the plugin
#: nexora-commerce-toolkit.php
msgid "Companion plugin for the Freshtastic Food Hub theme: optional built-in store that runs without WooCommerce, market data (units, origin, price history), request for quotation, store pickup and customer-booked courier delivery with time slots, modern order screens and an Order Desk staff role, registration consent records, reCAPTCHA and email login codes, demo content importer and cleanup, wishlist, newsletter provider integrations (Mailchimp, Brevo, Klaviyo), consent-aware analytics events (GA4, GTM, Meta Pixel, Google Ads) and testimonials. Features keep working if you switch themes."
msgstr ""

